        "id": 1312,
        "name": "Medal of Honor: Heroes",
        "summary": "Medal of Honor: Heroes is a World War II first-person shooter video game developed by Team Fusion for the PlayStation Portable. It is the ninth instalment in the Medal of Honor series.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co1pno.jpg",
