        "summary": "Fate/tiger colosseum is a 3D fighting video game based on the visual novel Fate/stay night. The characters are all rendered in a super deformed style. All characters from the Fate/stay night series, as well as the main characters of Fate/hollow ataraxia, Bazett Fraga McRemitz and Caren Ortensia, make an appearance as playable characters.",
