      {
        "id": 14607,
        "name": "Brave Story: New Traveler",
        "summary": "On a day that starts out like any other, an 11-year-old boy's life is changed forever when his friend Miki suddenly collapses from an unknown illness. Without the means to save her, he grows increasingly distraught when suddenly, a strange voice offers him a second chance: \"Beyond the door you can change your destiny!\" He soon leaves the real world and journeys to the world of Vision, where, as a novice \"Traveler,\" he will surmount myriad ordeals in hopes of ultimately meeting with the Goddess of Fortune to have a single wish granted.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co4epl.jpg",
