        "id": 42878,
        "name": "Kingdom of Paradise",
        "summary": "Kingdom of Paradise is a 3D martial arts role-playing game based on Eastern mythology. You can collect various fighting skills and items to tailor the fighting style of your character. There are more than 150 skills and items to collect, including some that can be downloaded via wireless Infrastructure Mode. In addition to the single-player story mode, you can also challenge other gamers via ad hoc wireless.",
